# Keep only portable repository guidance, retained skills, adapters, and CI.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!.github/
!.github/**
!agents/
!agents/*.toml
!agents/README.md
!agents/CHANGELOG.md
!skills/
!skills/AGENTS.md
!skills/ADDYOSMANI-AGENT-SKILLS-LICENSE
!skills/references/
!skills/references/**
!skills/skill-creator/
!skills/skill-creator/**

# Security boundary: never publish credentials, runtime state, or local stores.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*secret*
**/*credential*
**/*token*
**/*apikey*
**/*api_key*
**/auth.json
**/config.toml
**/hooks.json
**/*state*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-*
**/*history*.jsonl
**/sessions/**
**/logs/**
**/cache/**
**/attachments/**
**/backups/**

# Live resumable packets are repository-local and ignored by default.
.agents/sessions/**
